# Ramp6Control without the flurry: v_lite70 dark -> sound tabc09wave (loader sound index from a native run), no spell, v_lite70 lit; mode stays 2.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch v_lite70.light_on
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
190 poke info_text_box message_field 2
200 event a_ramp6 ControlBallToLayer2
195-205 expect sound 7
205 expect v_lite70.light_on == 1
205 expect mode == 2
250 quit
